@scene chapter_1_trial_failed

background: dragon_celestial.jpg
music: dragon_theme.mp3

dialogue:
"The dragon roars."
"The sound shakes the very foundations of the ruins."

npc Dragon:
"Power without wisdom..."
"...is nothing."
"You have failed the Trial."

system warning:
"STATS RECALIBRATED"
"Every stat has returned to its base value."
"HP 100 · STR 10 · DEF 10 · DEX 10 · MP 50"

background: ruins.png

dialogue:
"The stolen power drains out of you."
"You are left with exactly what you began with — and nothing more."
"You wait for the world to end."
"It does not."
"The dragon's enormous eye settles on you, and the fury in it has cooled."

npc Dragon:
"You are not being punished, {{player_name}}."
"You reached for power you did not understand."
"So you will be taught to understand it."
"Failure is not the end of your road."
"It is the beginning of your education."

dialogue:
"The great head lowers until it is level with you."
"Whatever comes next, it is not an ending."

